@format 1
@id functionality.media-loading.worklist
@title Media loading — Worklist only
@section Functionality
@area Media loading — Worklist only
@entry worklist-relay, delivered-output, clear-tabs, relay-source-remove, batch-evict
@summary Show only Worklist-specific operations that can add, clear, remove, or replace media in tab Files dockets.
@related functionality.media-loading.common.list-add, functionality.media-loading.common.list-clear, functionality.media-loading.common.list-removal
@tag media
@tag loading
@tag worklist

@alias roster = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PRoster
@alias list = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PList
@alias console = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PConsole
@alias strip = Cadroue.UIShell.PControlBar.PStrip

[worklist-relay] Worklist relay to tab <input>
- Resolve and select the requested relay target before replacing its unlocked paths and submitting relayed paths @ roster.PRosterRelaySend(...)
> worklist-target

[delivered-output] Delivered processing output <input>
- Resolve the requested destination or original tab that should receive the delivered path @ list.PListDeliveredAdd(...)
  @ list.PListDeliveredPlace(...)
> delivered-target

[clear-tabs] Worklist Clear Tabs command <input>
- After destructive confirmation, request media-content clearing for every tab @ console.PConsoleTabsHandle(...)
> clear-tabs-dispatch

[relay-source-remove] Post-delivery source removal <input>
- When relay-empty policy permits, resolve delivered source and merge-source paths and remove them from their source tab @ list.PListDeliveredRemove(...)
> map:functionality.media-loading.common.list-removal

[batch-evict] Worklist batch eviction <input>
- Resolve media belonging to batches that left the Worklist and remove those paths from matching Files dockets @ list.PListBatchEvict(...)
> map:functionality.media-loading.common.list-removal

[worklist-target] Worklist target availability <decision>
- Require the relay target to expose a Files docket; accepted paths then enter shared media discovery and insertion @ roster.PRosterRelaySend(...)
! Clearing existing unlocked target paths can publish a temporary replacement current path before newly relayed paths are added.
? "Target Files docket available" > map:functionality.media-loading.common.list-add
? "Target unavailable" > worklist-rejected

[delivered-target] Delivery target availability <decision>
- Require the requested destination to still expose a Files docket before scanning and inserting the delivered path @ list.PListDeliveredAdd(...)
  @ list.PListDeliveredPlace(...)
? "Target Files docket available" > map:functionality.media-loading.common.list-add
? "Target unavailable" > delivery-rejected

[clear-tabs-dispatch] Clear every tab workspace <process>
- Clear media content in every tab workspace; each list-backed workspace invokes PListClear for its Files panel @ strip.PStripContentClear(...)
> map:functionality.media-loading.common.list-clear

[worklist-rejected] Worklist relay rejected <output>
= No target Files intake occurs.

[delivery-rejected] Delivered output rejected <output>
= The output is not inserted into a target Files docket.
